.TH PRI 1.SH NAMEpri \- set a process's priority.SH SYNOPSIS\fBpri\fRpid priority.SH DESCRIPTIONA small Pascal program, the helper for W. Stehling's print spoolerprocedure on EFFO forum disk 4, that sets the priority of process\fIpid\fRto\fIpriority\fR.\fRIt prints nothing.  On this disk every call answers 221, module notfound, and what it is looking for has not been established.  OS-9's own\fBsetpr\fRdoes the same job..SH SEE ALSOsetpr, procs